{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12213060","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12213060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1221306001:1":{"text":"상자에 있는 노트를 전부 찾았어. 해미! 어서 노트에 뭐가 적혀있는지 확인해 보자!","source_cn":"箱子里的笔记全都找出来啦！漫漫，你快看看上面写的都是什么吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24E720A47A397EFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1221306002:1":{"text":"이, 이건...!","source_cn":"这、这些……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A701D33A4E5FD00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1221306002":{"text":"이, 이건...!","source_cn":"这、这些……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A701D33A4E5FD00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221306003:1":{"text":"이 노트는... 전부 제가 쓴 거예요!","source_cn":"这些笔记……全部都是我的字迹！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6E43DD9FBBE4813B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이 노트는... 전부 제가 쓴 거예요!","female":"이 노트는... 전부 제가 쓴 거예요!","variant_male_record_index":"135394","variant_female_record_index":"135395","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221306005:1":{"text":"응?! 네 노트가 왜 여기서 나와?!","source_cn":"哎？！你的笔记怎么会出现在这里？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77C46C5EEF9F4426","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221306006:1":{"text":"나도 모르겠어! 평소에 노트를 잘 보관하는 편이라 잃어버린 적도 없는데.","source_cn":"我也不知道呀！我平时的笔记都会好好收起来，也不记得有丢失过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA25AD5EB1B62CB3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1221306007:1":{"text":"하지만 이 노트의 내용은 전부 내가 직접 쓴 게 맞아...","source_cn":"可是这些笔记上的内容，也的确是我亲手写的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x911C600E584B1CC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1221306008:1":{"text":"... 너무 이상해! 노트에 수상한 점은 없어?","source_cn":"……太古怪了！这些笔记上就没有什么可疑的地方吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21A66033E2205808","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1221306009:1":{"text":"음, 어디 보자...","source_cn":"唔，让我仔细看看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x784BE7ADE18A6EEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1221306010:1":{"text":"...아!","source_cn":"——啊！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE12C1D94BEF942F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1221306011:1":{"text":"으악! 왜 그래?!","source_cn":"呜哇！怎么了？！","stat